# DEPLOY-2026 (GOV-722) — keep registry + raw data OUT of the build context.
# INV-7: only code and migration SQL enter an image; nothing private (the DB, the
# raw vault, run logs, secrets) is ever copyable into a layer.
Database/*.db
Database/*.db-journal
Database/*.db-wal
Database/*.db-shm
Raw-PDFs/
Raw-Corpus/
Transcripts/
Docs/Source-Data/
Logs/
deploy/.env
deploy/data/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.git/
graphify-out/
